ying  you're painting a way that the speed at  which your brain works if you paint  let's go or than that it's too fast  first in your brain you you can't catch  it so you have to kind of find out what  works for your thinking process so for  me the way that was possible was by  being quite direct on the canvas is not  a pre-planned things anyway  compositional matters go out the window  because that's not for me the way that  it'll become a lot
 

